ValueSet: CancerRegistryDHPStatusTargetVS
Id: cancer-registry-dhp-status-target-vs
Title: "Cancer Registry DHP Status Mapping Targets"
Description: "Target concepts used by the Cancer Registry dictionary-to-DHP status ConceptMap across its code systems. This scope preserves all existing mappings and enables target-code validation."
* insert IntegrationsValueSet(cancer-registry-dhp-status-target-vs)
* ^status = #draft
* ^experimental = false

